          <span class="weo-chip current">Apr '26: Shadow of War ▲</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 2+3: RISKS + INFLATION (two-column) -->
    <div class="two-col-grid" data-reveal>

      <!-- SECTION 2: DOWNSIDE RISKS -->
      <section aria-labelledby="risks-heading">
        <div class="section-label">Section 2</div>
        <h3 id="risks-heading" class="section-title">Dominant Downside Risks</h3>
        <div class="risk-grid">
          <div class="risk-card">
            <div class="risk-card-icon">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D97706" stroke-width="2.5">
                <rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" rx="1"/>
                <path d="M16 8l6-2-2 6M16 16l6 2-2-6"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4>Trade Policy Escalation</h4>
            <p>Tariff increases and retaliatory measures from 2025 onward; front-loading of activity temporarily masks damage.</p>
            <span class="risk-severity high">● High</span>
          </div>
          <div class="risk-card">
            <div class="risk-card-icon">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D97706" stroke-width="2.5">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/>
                <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 014 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 014-10z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4>Geopolitical Tensions</h4>
