            <span class="risk-severity high">● High</span>
          </div>
          <div class="risk-card">
            <div class="risk-card-icon">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D97706" stroke-width="2.5">
                <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4>Services Inflation Persistence</h4>
            <p>US inflation projected to return to target more gradually; services inflation slows disinflation globally.</p>
            <span class="risk-severity medium">● Moderate</span>
          </div>
          <div class="risk-card">
            <div class="risk-card-icon">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D97706" stroke-width="2.5">
                <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h4>AI &amp; Tech Re-evaluation</h4>
            <p>Elevated expectations around AI investment could face corrections; technology cycle uncertainty persists.</p>
            <span class="risk-severity medium">● Moderate</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION 3: INFLATION & MONETARY POLICY -->
      <section aria-labelledby="inflation-heading">
        <div class="section-label">Section 3</div>
        <h3 id="inflation-heading" class="section-title">Inflation Outlook &amp; Monetary Policy</h3>
        <div class="inflation-card">
          <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.5">Global disinflation continues, enabling the monetary policy pivot — but the path is uneven. The US lags peer economies.</p>
          <div class="inflation-chart-container">
            <canvas id="inflationChart" role="img" aria-label="Bar chart comparing inflation trajectory across Global, US, and Advanced Economies from 2024 to 2026, showing declining trend with US remaining above target longer"></canvas>
          </div>
          <div class="inflation-note">
            <strong style="color:#D97706">US Exception:</strong> US inflation projected to remain above target longer than peer economies. Renewed inflationary pressures emerged Apr 2026 from defense spending and supply disruptions.
          </div>
        </div>
