    </div>

    <!-- SECTION 4: POLICY EVOLUTION TIMELINE -->
    <section class="policy-section" aria-labelledby="policy-heading" data-reveal>
      <div class="section-label">Section 4 — Narrative Spine</div>
      <h3 id="policy-heading" class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:4px">Evolving Policy Priorities: From Monetary Pivot to Defense Trade-offs</h3>
      <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:0">IMF policy guidance has shifted significantly across six periods, reflecting the evolving macro-financial landscape.</p>
      <div class="policy-timeline" role="list">
